1. Representational structure a. Systematicity b. Compositionality c. Productivity (the problem of variables) d. The massive binding problem (the problem of two)
2. Performance concerns a. Syntactic generalization b. Robustness c. Adaptability d. Memory
3. Scientific merit a. Triangulation (Contact with more sources of data) b. Compactness
